            "review_title": "Review at Izakaya Mainichi",
            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary20540 contributions\n4\nEarly dinner\nDec 2024 • Business\nDinner in Japanese restaurant. Sushi, Sashimi, grilled fish, eel and salad. Tried different meals and having draft Sapporo beer. Located opposite becamex hotel over the street with numbers of other restaurants. We got food quick as not so many people came for earlier dinner as we did\nInsider tip:\nIt fits small groups which look for privacy and the tables are different floors\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 14, 2024",
